[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_2rbrg"]
script = ExtResource("5_5hxe2")
markedup_text = "Let the rivalry play out."
outcome = SubResource("Resource_w3tyb")
markedup_result_text = "The crowd stands back and watches the kites dive and swoop like hawks.

A sharp snap echoes across the field as the potters' line is severed, their kite drifting helplessly into the sky, as cheers and groans erupt.

The rivalry is bound to escalate, but for a moment, everyone forgot the hardship of their daily labor in the thrill of the fight."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_u5rfg"]
script = ExtResource("3_4c8pp")
markedup_text = "The wind is strong today, but the mood on the field is heated.

Two groups of settlers, the millers and the potters, are engaged in a kite battle. Their strings are coated in glue and crushed pottery shards, designed to saw through an opponent's line.

Wagers are piling up on the sidelines. \"It's all in good fun,\" a young miller argues, bandaging a cut on his finger. \"And besides, they insulted our flour.\""
background_image = SubResource("Resource_wpb01")
background_credit = ExtResource("5_wpb01")
choices = Array[ExtResource("5_5hxe2")]([SubResource("Resource_mn1kc"), SubResource("Resource_10ls2"), SubResource("Resource_nx2w7")])
exit_choice = SubResource("Resource_2rbrg")

